            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure provides a User Equipment (UE) comprising a transceiver circuit; and a controller configured to control the transceiver circuit to send, to an Access and mobility Management Function (AMF) of a communication node, an identifier, wherein upon successful authentication of a network access function of the UE in the communication node, the controller is configured to maintain a secure connection with the communication node.</p>
            </abstract>
